# Real software, next sizes, no time limit (owner 2026-11-09 01:55: instances outside Tables 1-2 run without a timeout; the question is how far the exploration goes). brain01, Offline only.
# Replaces realsw-next-brain01.rows (48 h tier), whose dispatcher the owner stops before this queue starts; nothing of it had launched.
# raft-rs: (1,2,2), (1,3,1) exports and joins against S_raft; (2,1,1) export retried (the 11-04 run died of a full disk) and joined with the existing S_raft export.
# MicroRaft: the (1,1,2) and (2,1,1) exports under JMC, then joins against the Rust S_raft and against raft-rs in both directions ((2,1,1) raft-rs export must finish first for its twin joins).
# OmniPaxos: (3,0,1) and (2,0,2) exports and joins against S_raft.
C3E.raft-rs.spec_correct_1_2_2_fifo.t16.cinf 250 8640000 "$DAAVAR"/scripts/rust-run.sh raft-rs export spec --out export.jsonl --threads 16 --model fifo -- correct 1 2 2
C3E.raft-rs.impl_correct_1_2_2_fifo.t16.cinf 250 8640000 "$DAAVAR"/scripts/rust-run.sh raft-rs export impl --out export.jsonl --threads 16 --model fifo -- correct 1 2 2
